==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*govoriti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*gow(H)-||to call, cry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|говори́ть}}
* {{audio|Ru-говорить.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|говори́ть|impf|pf=сказа́ть|pf2=поговори́ть}}

# to [[speak]], to [[talk]]
#: {{ru-ux|[[я|Я]] '''говорю́''' [[по-ру́сски]].|I '''speak''' Russian.|inline=y}}
# to [[say]], to [[tell]]
#: {{ru-ux|[[что|Что]] [[она́]] '''говори́т'''?|What '''is''' she '''saying'''?|inline=y}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|4b+p|говор}}

